{
  "app": "lionfish",
  "note": "Held-out benchmark set (gates/leaf-AG2.md G5/G6): paraphrases and new questions the prompts never saw. Same schema as the main file plus paraphraseOf and changelog.",
  "changelog": [
    {
      "date": "2026-10-01",
      "by": "AG2",
      "change": "created before the final tuning runs: paraphrases of documented questions (paraphraseOf) and new questions across the ten categories; not edited after seeing results."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-01",
      "by": "AG2",
      "change": "population forbids: the negated form still matched when a possessive sat between the negation and the noun (\"whether Belize's lionfish population is growing\"); the lookbehind now exempts a negation word anywhere earlier in the sentence (1 pattern)."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-10-01",
      "by": "AG2",
      "change": "lh-replay-ranking-month-ago: the span phrase took only \"month\" or \"30 days\"; \"30-day\" and \"four weeks\" name the same span, so the pattern now takes those spellings too (1 pattern; the same spelling fix the main sets got)."
    }
  ],
